OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CToday:FToday will remain dry with some 
OL,6,Fpatchy cloud. It will feel cold with   
OL,7,Fan east to southeasterly breeze and    
OL,8,Ftemperatures near or just below        
OL,9,Faverage for the time of year.          
OL,11,CTonight:FA cold night to follow, with  
OL,12,Fcloud. Rain, perhaps with some sleet   
OL,13,Fover hills at first and stronger winds 
OL,14,Fmove into the far west of the region.  
OL,16,CFriday:FWidespread rain through much   
OL,17,Fof the day, particularly in the west,  
OL,18,Fwith some gusty winds at first.        
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
