OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FWet    
OL,6,Fand windy on Saturday before clearing  
OL,7,Fto the east by the evening, as the     
OL,8,Fwinds ease into Sunday, before         
OL,9,Fincreasing again and showers follow,   
OL,10,Fturning milder. Monday generally       
OL,11,Fcloudy.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
